    "representation": "pdf-text-entry",
    "text": "A subgroup H is called a virtual retract of a group G if H is a retract of\na finite-index subgroup of G. Is it true that every finitely generated subgroup of a\nfinitely generated virtually free group is a virtual retract?\n    For motivation and partial results see (A. Minasyan, Int. Math. Res. Notes,\n2021, no. 17 (2021), 13434–13477).                                       A. Minasyan",
